* S9: immutable S7b included verbatim; only filter/amp/ADC timing changed.
.include "../../CH1_entrada/comun/ch1_comun_s7b.inc"
* Pin order is symbolic, not SOIC package pin numbers.
.subckt LM6172_W IP IM VP VN OUT
XCORE IP IM VP VN OUT LM6172/NS
.ends LM6172_W
.subckt AMP_S9_A IP IM VP VN OUT
XA IP IM VP VN OUT AD8038
.ends AMP_S9_A
.subckt AMP_S9_B IP IM VP VN OUT
XB IP IM VP VN OUT LM6172_W
.ends AMP_S9_B
* AMP_S9 is bound by the deck generator from AMP_S9_SELECT (0=A,1=B).
* Exactly one manufacturer instance, never two inactive loaded amplifiers.
.subckt SK_S9 IN OUT VP VN IP IM params: RA=1k RB=1k CF=100p CG=100p VOS=0 AMP=0
R1 IN MID {RA}
R2 MID PLUS {RB}
C1 MID OUT {CF}
C2 PLUS 0 {CG}
CPCB PLUS 0 {CPCB_S7}
VIP PLUS IP 0
VOS IP IPR {VOS}
VIM OUT IM 0
VCCP VP VPP 0
VCCN VN VNN 0
XAMP IPR IM VPP VNN OUT AMP_S9 KIND={AMP}
