.subckt CHANNEL_S9 BNC PIN VP VN VDDA VREF DAC params: POS=1 CODE=0 CPL=0 VO101=0 VOA=0 VOB=0 VOFA=0 VOFB=0 VO836=0 AMP=0 F1=2.49k F2=1.10k
XFE BNC RAWIN VP VN M TAP RSM X1 EQ SEL B T2 FRONT_S7B POS={POS} CPL={CPL}
VI101 RAWIN BI 0
VOS101 BI BIR {VO101}
